@host = http://localhost:6010
@token = <paste a JWT from /api/auth/login>

### List projects
GET {{host}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create project
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Warehouse automation rollout",
  "customerId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "currencyCode": "USD"
}

### Open the project (enums are numeric in requests: Planning=0, Quote=1, Open=2, Completed=3)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": 2 }
